  "description": "Nisha, who wants to live an ordinary life, hears rumours of a serial killer around her. One full moon night, she discovers a man dragging a bag containing a person down a dark alley. She tries to run away, but ends up losing consciousness... When Nisha wakes up, the man suddenly flashes his red eyes and speaks with a slightly excited expression. 'You're not human, are you?'\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/fullmoon_accident)",
